    }), "\n", _jsx(_components.p, {
      children: "Start with observability, not as an afterthought. The most common mistake teams make is deploying an agent to production and then trying to add monitoring afterward. CloudWatch dashboards, X-Ray sampling configuration, and custom metric instrumentation should all be part of your initial deployment, not a follow-up task. The cost of retrofitting observability into a system that's already serving production traffic is significantly higher than building it in from the start."
    }), "\n", _jsx(_components.p, {
