    }), "\n", _jsx(_components.p, {
      children: "Build circuit breakers for tool dependencies. Your agents are only as reliable as their tools. If a dependent API becomes slow or unavailable, your agent will time out on every invocation that needs that tool, flooding your error metrics and degrading the user experience. Implementing circuit breaker patterns in your tool integration layer-where repeated failures cause the tool to short-circuit and return a structured error immediately, rather than waiting for a timeout-prevents cascading degradation and makes agent failures faster and more predictable."
